1
00:00:00,308 --> 00:00:02,838
(Howard:)It's like going
with your grandpa.

2
00:00:02,844 --> 00:00:04,244
(Howard:)Instead of eating popcorn,

3
00:00:04,245 --> 00:00:06,475
(Howard:)he brings little pieces
of chicken in Tupperware

4
00:00:06,481 --> 00:00:08,881
(Howard:)and a thermos full of soup.

5
00:00:08,883 --> 00:00:10,913
(Leonard:)He's not that bad.

6
00:00:10,919 --> 00:00:13,989
(Leonard:)Hey, Stuart, got any plans
Thursday night?

7
00:00:13,988 --> 00:00:16,688
(Stuart:)My, uh... my doctor's worried
about my circulation,

8
00:00:16,691 --> 00:00:19,561
(Stuart:)so I was thinking about
walking around the mall.

9
00:00:19,561 --> 00:00:21,191
(Stuart:)Why?

10
00:00:21,196 --> 00:00:23,366
(Sheldon:)Well...
Hey, you guys.

11
00:00:23,364 --> 00:00:24,994
(Howard:)Oh, make sure
to wear sensible shoes.

12
00:00:24,999 --> 00:00:27,229
(Howard:)Wil, want to go
to Star Wars Thursday?

13
00:00:27,235 --> 00:00:28,365
(Wil:)Absolutely.

14
00:00:28,369 --> 00:00:29,939
(Stuart:)Fine, take Wil.

15
00:00:29,938 --> 00:00:32,208
See if he brings you
clam chowder.

16
00:00:34,375 --> 00:00:36,145
(Penny:)Okay, okay, okay,
okay, okay.

17
00:00:36,144 --> 00:00:38,114
Let's-let's... let's just
recap our options.

18
00:00:38,112 --> 00:00:41,312
(Penny:)All right, we've got
harp thing, sheep thing...

19
00:00:41,316 --> 00:00:43,116
(Bernadette:)Wild thang.

20
00:00:45,853 --> 00:00:47,683
(Sheldon:)Which do you think
she'd prefer?

21
00:00:47,689 --> 00:00:51,459
(Sheldon:)Because I checked the Sheep
and Wool Festival Web site,

22
00:00:51,459 --> 00:00:53,929
(Sheldon:)and there's only
8,000 tickets left.

23
00:00:55,863 --> 00:00:58,763
(Penny:)Sheldon, being physical with
Amy is a huge step for you.

24
00:00:58,766 --> 00:01:00,566
(Bernadette:)Yeah, are you ready
for this?

